title: Recruitment Drive
new-page: true
view-if: crisis = 0 and congress = 0 and recruitment_timer <= 0
on-arrival: recruitment_timer = 3; month_actions += 1
frequency: 300
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs

= Recruitment Drive

[? if year = 1919 or (year = 1920 and month < 4) : Thousands of workers are disappointed in Ebert's republic. ?][? if year = 1920 and month >= 4 : After the Kapp days, many workers want a party that will fight. ?][? if year >= 1921 : A mass party has to keep growing, or it shrinks. ?] Only the districts loyal to the Zentrale will put real work into a drive.

- @drive: Pay for a national drive.
- @tested: Admit only tested militants.
- @open: Open the doors to everyone.
- @easy_discard

@drive
subtitle: Costs 1 fund. Loyal districts grow fast; the others take the money.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: We have no funds.
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 1;
for (var d of Q.districts) {
    var grow = Q['district_' + d + '_loyalty'] >= 50 ? 0.15 : 0.04;
    Q['district_' + d + '_members'] *= 1 + grow;
}
!}

@tested
subtitle: Few new members, and the red guards can trust them.
on-arrival: {!
for (var d of Q.districts) {
    Q['district_' + d + '_members'] *= 1.02;
}
Q.red_guards_loyalty += 6;
Q.lean_offensive += 1;
!}

Each new member must be vouched for by two comrades who have seen them in a strike.

@open
subtitle: Many join everywhere. The districts drift further from Berlin.
on-arrival: {!
for (var d of Q.districts) {
    Q['district_' + d + '_members'] *= 1.07;
    Q['district_' + d + '_loyalty'] -= 4;
}
!}

The districts recruit in their own way and in their own image.
